        },
        {
          "text": "Mara ilipotangaa amri, wana wa Israeli wakatoa kwa wingi malimbuko ya nafaka, na divai, na mafuta, na asali, na mazao yote ya mashamba; na zaka za vitu vyote wakazileta nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
