          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Hezekia akaamuru kutengeneza vyumba nyumbani mwa BWANA; wakavitengeneza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 13:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayaingiza matoleo na zaka na vitu vilivyowekwa wakfu, kwa uaminifu; na juu yake Konania Mlawi alikuwa mkuu, na wa pili ni Shimei nduguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yehieli, na Azaria, na Nahathi, na Asaheli, na Yerimothi, na Yozabadi, na Elieli, na Ismakia, na Mahathi, na Benaya, walikuwa wasimamizi chini ya mkono wa Konania na Shimei nduguye, kwa amri ya Hezekia mfalme, na Azaria mkuu wa nyumba ya Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Kore, mwana wa Imna, Mlawi, bawabu wa mlango wa mashariki, alizisimamia sadaka za hiari za Mungu; ili kugawa matoleo ya BWANA, navyo vitu vilivyokuwa vitakatifu sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
